coder v0.0.0-devel

USAGE:
  coder workspace-proxy edit [flags] <name|id>

  Edit a workspace proxy

OPTIONS:
  -c, --column [id|name|display name|icon url|healthy|url|wildcard hostname|derp enabled|derp only|proxy status|proxy report|proxy checked at|created at|updated at|deleted|version] (default: name,url)
          Columns to display in table output.

      --display-name string
          (Optional) Display name of the proxy. A more human friendly name to be
          displayed.

      --icon string
          (Optional) Display icon of the proxy.

      --name string
          (Optional) Name of the proxy. This is used to identify the proxy.

  -o, --output text|json|table (default: text)
          Output format.

———
Run `coder --help` for a list of global options.
